PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_OakCongratulations::
    .string "OAK: Er-hem!\n"
    .string "Congratulations, {PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "This floor is the POKéMON HALL OF\n"
    .string "FAME.\p"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPIONS are\n"
    .string "honored for their exploits here.\p"
    .string "Their POKéMON are also recorded in\n"
    .string "the HALL OF FAME.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "You have worked hard to become\n"
    .string "the new LEAGUE CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "Congratulations, {PLAYER}, you and\n"
    .string "your POKéMON are HALL OF FAMERS!$"


PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_JirachiAppears::
    .string "A soft golden light drifts into\n"
    .string "the HALL OF FAME.\p"
    .string "A small star-shaped POKéMON floats\n"
    .string "down and rests on your shoulder.\p"
    .string "It is JIRACHI, the wish POKéMON.\p"
    .string "It woke up for the first time in\n"
    .string "a thousand years, just for you.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_JirachiAsks::
    .string "Its third eye opens.\p"
    .string "The wish is yours to make.\p"
    .string "Whatever you choose, the world will\n"
    .string "remember it.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_EndingLetGo::
    .string "You shake your head, and smile.\p"
    .string "JIRACHI hums, light as a feather,\n"
    .string "and rises into the sky.\p"
    .string "Far away, the AURA settles. TEAM\n"
    .string "ONYBRIS falls silent.\p"
    .string "Your journey is not over.\n"
    .string "The road goes on.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_EndingNoBalls::
    .string "You wish that no POKéMON ever has\n"
    .string "to be kept in a POKé BALL again.\p"
    .string "Every BALL in the world cracks open\n"
    .string "at the same instant.\p"
    .string "Your partners look at you once,\n"
    .string "and walk back into the wild.\p"
    .string "No more captures. No more battles.\n"
    .string "A quiet world.\p"
    .string "THE END.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_EndingRuleAll::
    .string "You wish for every legendary POKéMON\n"
    .string "to answer to you alone.\p"
    .string "MEWTWO, the three birds, MEW and\n"
    .string "CELEBI all appear in your PC.\p"
    .string "The weather, the seas, the mountains\n"
    .string "obey your word now.\p"
    .string "Was this the right wish?\p"
    .string "THE END.$"
